            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A computer-implemented method comprising: determining characteristic data of an image; determining, based on the characteristic data, a virtual aperture size of an optical system; causing the optical system to scan the image at a resolution based on a physical aperture size of the optical system; and modifying the resolution of the scanned image based on the virtual aperture size of the optical system.</p>
